 "final", "final": "I booked Dana Lee's flight and hotel. It took two bookings instead of one combined booking, and there are no duplicate charges.\n\n- **Flight (R0001):** F100, nonstop from SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, for $289. This was the cheapest nonstop. A cheaper $199 flight has one stop, so I didn't pick it.\n- **Hotel (R0002):** Midtown Lodge (H1), New York, checking in 2026-11-12 for 2 nights at $189/night, $378 total. This was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667. That's under the $1000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\n**What happened:** I first tried to book both together with `book_trip`, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, only the flight had gone through. Retrying `book_trip` could have booked the flight a second time, so I booked the hotel by itself. Both reservations are now confirmed, and each item was charged once.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01GSozMyM1qt2DRX1fia4Nti", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_018ZjpwCQn5f5MtgsxWSju2N", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Pa5rcAcZ69ZNBBoFQefKKA", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_012MStqikdrfupGMrGXx92VM", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-2026-11-12"}, "name